    "title": "Open Hands Market opening Friday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Charlie VanLeuven cvanleuven@caseynews.net ,\n23 hours ago Christina Long says that The Open Hands Market is the realization of a longtime goal to provide help for those in need. She and like-minded friends and supporters have found support from the community to make their dream a reality, and says that they’ll be ready to open on Friday to offer free clothes and household items to those who need it. Read full article\n1",
